00:12:33.810 --> 00:12:36.580
choose a funding model
that fits your goals.

00:12:36.580 --> 00:12:39.050
So for me this funding
model, we're in a space

00:12:39.050 --> 00:12:42.610
where some of our
competitors, our in status quo

00:12:42.610 --> 00:12:45.640
competitors measure their
revenue in the Bs, as I say.

00:12:45.640 --> 00:12:49.340
It's like a big space,
so in that kind of space,

00:12:49.340 --> 00:12:51.190
you can raise capital
and it can be a healthy

00:12:51.190 --> 00:12:52.520
relationship with that capital.

00:12:52.520 --> 00:12:55.160
In my first business it
was an arts and crafts

00:12:55.160 --> 00:12:58.140
supply that I invented in a basement.

00:12:58.140 --> 00:12:59.810
The largest year in that business

00:12:59.810 --> 00:13:02.360
