00:13:02.360 --> 00:13:03.650
If I had raised capital in that business,

00:13:03.650 --> 00:13:04.483
big mistake.

00:13:04.483 --> 00:13:07.590
So fit your funding
goal, your funding method

00:13:07.590 --> 00:13:09.957
to your goals, personally,
and your business's goals.

00:13:09.957 --> 00:13:12.730
- Aka, venture capital
isn't the only route

00:13:12.730 --> 00:13:13.809
